{"id":"u-84909327-7419-4c10-9c76-86224c65e650","src":"community","title":"Hypertrophy Protocol by Kirankvc","author":"Kiran  C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/CWelVG-kirankvc-push-pull-legs","desc":"🎯 What You’ll Achieve:\nTargeted Muscle Growth: Hit each major muscle group twice per week, using varied angles, tempo, and resistance to stimulate hypertrophy.\n\nEnhanced Mind-Muscle Connection: Improve form, focus, and muscle activation with a smart selection of compound and isolation exercises.\n\nStrength + Aesthetic Gains: You won’t just look better — you’ll get stronger and more functionally fit.\n\nTraining Consistency: A fixed 6-day structure removes guesswork, builds discipline, and keeps your momentum high.\n\n🏋️‍♂️ Program Structure:\nDay 1: Push A – Chest, Shoulders, Triceps\n\nDay 2: Pull A – Back, Biceps\n\nDay 3: Legs A – Quads, Hamstrings, Calves\n\nDay 4: Push B – New angles & movement patterns\n\nDay 5: Pull B – Strength focus + rear delts\n\nDay 6: Legs B – Glutes, hamstrings, advanced variations\n\nDay 7: Rest – Active recovery, mobility, foam rolling\n\nEvery week is intentionally programmed for volume progression, exercise variety, and muscle fatigue management. You’ll be hitting muscles hard — but not burning out.\n\n⚡ Who It’s For:\nIntermediate to advanced lifters who want to focus on size\n\nGym-goers stuck in a plateau or “repeating the same routine”\n\nAnyone serious about building muscle, improving physique, and gaining strength without fluff\n\nAthletes looking to balance aesthetics with performance\n\n🧠 The KCX Philosophy:\nYou don’t need fancy machines or endless cardio.\nYou need consistency, intensity, and a proven plan.\nThis is that plan.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-14T14:12:48.756Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push A Chest Focused","Pull A (Back-Focused)","Legs A","Push B (Different Angles)","Pull B (Different Angles)","Legs B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Crossover","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Decline Sit Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Plank (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":30,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Row","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r